       - a label carried by BOTH a node and its parent, at the same centre (one button)
       - two labels that share a prefix at DIFFERENT positions (genuinely ambiguous)
       - a node with no label at all
       - a node whose bounds attribute is malformed -->
<hierarchy rotation="0">
